{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30245","headline":"宣政殿前陪位观册顺宗宪宗皇帝尊号 · 薛逢","name":"宣政殿前陪位观册顺宗宪宗皇帝尊号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼头钟鼓遰相催，曙色当衙晓仗开。\n孔雀扇分香案出，兖龙衣动册函来。\n金泥照耀传中旨，玉节从容引上台。\n盛礼永尊徽号毕，圣慈南面不胜哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}